     "p": {
      "ar": "خدمات حقيقية في CI بـ `services:` (Postgres، Redis) — نفس نسخة الإنتاج. وشغّل الترحيلات قبل الاختبارات. والاختبارات البطيئة (e2e بـ Playwright) في job منفصل أو كل ليلة عشان الـ PR يفضل سريع.",
      "en": "Real services in CI with `services:` (Postgres, Redis) — the same version as production. Run migrations before the tests. And keep slow tests (Playwright e2e) in a separate job or nightly so PRs stay fast."
     },
     "ex": "integration:\n  runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n  services:\n    postgres:\n      image: postgres:17\n      env: { POSTGRES_PASSWORD: ci-only, POSTGRES_DB: shop_test }\n      ports: [\"5432:5432\"]\n      options: --health-cmd \"pg_isready\" --health-interval 5s --health-retries 10\n  env: { DATABASE_URL: \"postgres://postgres:ci-only@localhost:5432/shop_test\" }\n  steps:\n    - uses: actions/checkout@v5\n    - uses: actions/setup-node@v5\n      with: { node-version: 22, cache: npm }\n    - run: npm ci --ignore-scripts\n    - run: npm run migrate\n    - run: node --test test/integration/",
     "lang": "text"
